{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And her foundations shall be.</b> Like כי השתות יהרסון (Psalms 11:3). The foundations that they build to catch fish." "<b>All who make a dam.</b> Like ויסכרו מעינות תהום (Genesis 8:2). And if it is with shin [i.e., שכר], and like it: בשורי מהם (Hosea 9:12)." "<b>Pools of soul.</b> The pools where the souls of fish are."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {1 "The comment addresses a reading or variant involving שכר versus סכר; the precise sense of the comparison to Hosea 9:12 is left cryptic as in the original."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:18.000270213Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}